      "message": "Don\u0027t know if you are commenting in my idea, but this class is already aware that there is something called Scope, getting the metrics-handler for this Scope doesn\u0027t tell RecieveCommits anything about the existence of SSH and/or HTTP.",
      "parentUuid": "d2d83397_a4109bc2",
